NAME
    syscalls - Read permitted system-call facility information.

SYNOPSIS
    syscalls | syscall

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Runs as an isolated userland command and issues Get(command.syscalls.get). Native Inu system calls use the Get, Set and Event classes with structured AppName/PID/Message envelopes; Linux and NT compatibility namespaces may retain numeric syscall identifiers.

ALIASES
    syscall

FILES
    /System/Commands/SYSCALL.CMD
    /INU/HELP/SYSCALL.MAN
